#: grid.cpp:379
msgid "Note: The number of columns takes precedence."
msgstr "Beacht bitte: De Tall vun Striepen geiht vör."

#: grid.cpp:381
msgid "Note: The number of rows takes precedence."
msgstr "Beacht bitte: De Tall vun Regen geiht vör."

#. i18n: file: gridConfig.ui:19
#. i18n: ectx: property (windowTitle), widget (QWidget, gridConfig)
#. i18n: file: gridConfig.ui:22
#. i18n: ectx: property (accessibleName), widget (QWidget, gridConfig)
#: rc.cpp:3 rc.cpp:6
msgid "Configure Grid"
msgstr "Gadder instellen"

#. i18n: file: gridConfig.ui:62
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, rowLabel)
#: rc.cpp:9
msgid ""
"Here you can set the number of columns to be used. Note that in vertical "
"panels, this means the maximum number of rows, so your grid will never be "
"higher than that. It will expand horizontally instead, i.e. add more columns."
msgstr ""
"Hier kannst Du de Tall vun Striepen fastleggen, de Du bruken wullt. In "
"pielrecht Paneels is dat de Hööchsttall vun Regen, dat Gadder warrt nienich "
"höger as disse Tall. Ansteed wasst dat kimmrecht, kriggt also mehr Striepen."

#. i18n: file: gridConfig.ui:65
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, rowLabel)
#: rc.cpp:12
msgid "Number of rows"
msgstr "Tall vun Regen"

#. i18n: file: gridConfig.ui:78
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, colLabel)
#: rc.cpp:15
msgid ""
"Here you can set the number of columns to be used. Note that in vertical "
"panels, this means the maximum number of columns, so your grid will never be "
"wider than that. It will expand vertically instead, i.e. add more rows."
msgstr ""
"Hier kannst Du de Tall vun Regen fastleggen, de Du bruken wullt. In "
"kimmrecht Paneels is dat de Hööchsttall vun Striepen, dat Gadder warrt "
"nienich breder as disse Tall. Ansteed wasst dat pielrecht, kriggt also mehr "
"Regen."

#. i18n: file: gridConfig.ui:81
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, colLabel)
#: rc.cpp:18
msgid "Number of columns"
msgstr "Tall vun Striepen"

#. i18n: file: gridConfig.ui:96
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, note)
#: rc.cpp:21
msgid "Note about row/columns precedence"
msgstr "Gaht Regen oder Striepen vör?"
